{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WTF AM I PLAYING?!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the game that makes you ask... well, exactly that. If you\u2019re tired of logic, rules, and sensible gameplay, congratulations \u2014 you\u2019re in the right place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880350/extras/8684286aa7f81cc42182f5af8a5dac4a.poster.avif?t=1762127336\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880350/extras/8684286aa7f81cc42182f5af8a5dac4a.webm?t=1762127336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880350/extras/8684286aa7f81cc42182f5af8a5dac4a.mp4?t=1762127336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t your grandma\u2019s FPS. It\u2019s a fast-paced, retro-inspired chaos  full of weird enemies, ridiculous weapons, and moments that will make you question your life choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you can handle the madness? You\u2019ll be figuring things out on the fly, doing your best to keep up, and maybe wondering how you got here.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880350/extras/49c04c460ee5f13458aa53e532e202a9.poster.avif?t=1762127336\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880350/extras/49c04c460ee5f13458aa53e532e202a9.webm?t=1762127336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880350/extras/49c04c460ee5f13458aa53e532e202a9.mp4?t=1762127336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So grab your keyboard and mouse, and prepare to question the name of the game!<br>------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WTF AM I PLAYING?!</strong> is a first-person shooter with elements of platforming, puzzles, and experimental comedy. It blends fast-paced action with unexpected scenarios, minimal guidance, and surreal humor.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay &amp; Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uniquely designed levels with their own mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person shooter gameplay with puzzle and platforming elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized retro graphics and effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique enemies: angry chickens, mutant burgers, giant gorillas, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic soundtrack and sound design tailored to each level\u2019s tone.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No loading screens between core sequences \u2014 just smooth, weird transitions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short session-friendly level structure. (15\u201320 minutes per level.)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main content offers around 2\u20133 hours of gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And yes \u2014 you\u2019ll keep wondering what\u2019s going on, and why you\u2019re enjoying it.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Perfect for players who enjoy:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unconventional, unpredictable gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro-inspired visuals and effects that evoke classic gaming nostalgia.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced FPS action with a twist of humor and unexpected challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players with no expectations.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...Coming Soon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880350/extras/68183cd2b4e0726727eb5ecaeb00610d.poster.avif?t=1762127336\" width=1280 height=720 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880350/extras/68183cd2b4e0726727eb5ecaeb00610d.webm?t=1762127336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880350/extras/68183cd2b4e0726727eb5ecaeb00610d.mp4?t=1762127336\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3880350?t=1762127336","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880350/7b2e4942988d0ae6754291c5a89014b73224605e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762127336","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880350/aedfa31209043601991f2670c8d91c4cc033244c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762127336","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880350/aedfa31209043601991f2670c8d91c4cc033244c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762127336","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Includes cartoon-style, bloodless violence."},"demos":[{"appid":4048680,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WTF AM I PLAYING?!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the game that makes you ask... well, exactly that. If you\u2019re tired of logic, 